    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d282">

                <pb facs="0336" n="276" sameAs="frus:frus1895p1/pg276"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Adee to Mr. Eustis</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-08-24"><hi rendition="#italic">August 24,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Do what you legally and properly can to secure the effects of Waller’s wife from
                    search on her arrival France. She is believed to carry important documents in
                    his case.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Adee</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Acting</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
